# ATLAS with its judge, shared by the full ATLAS arms (not an arm by itself): the judge (ota_judge.env) labels each
# training trial's critical steps, and the other steps leave the loss (prl/algo/labeler.py, transforms/atlas.py;
# a hard mask unless PRL_TRANSFORM_ARGS sets other_weight). The smoke's receipt records the judge settings and
# the full launcher requires the same ones (scripts/checks/grpo_acceptance.py JUDGE_KEYS), so set any override on
# every job.
source "$PRL_ROOT/configs/arms/ota_judge.env"
PRL_TRANSFORM=atlas
PRL_TRANSFORM_ARGS=${PRL_TRANSFORM_ARGS:-}
